    },
    {
      "text": "on that show acting cowardly and and and",
      "start": 409.12,
      "duration": 5.04
    },
    {
      "text": "making decisions based on what will",
      "start": 411.84,
      "duration": 5.52
    },
    {
      "text": "affect their super chats the most. And I",
      "start": 414.16,
      "duration": 7.24
    },
    {
      "text": "really I don't judge them for it because",
      "start": 417.36,
      "duration": 5.4
    },
    {
      "text": "I",
      "start": 421.4,
      "duration": 3.16
    },
    {
      "text": "would have done the same thing three or",
      "start": 422.76,
      "duration": 4.64
    },
    {
      "text": "four years ago, too.",
      "start": 424.56,
      "duration": 4.48
    },
    {
      "text": "I learned",
      "start": 427.4,
      "duration": 4.88
    },
    {
      "text": "by being on the receiving end of mobs",
      "start": 429.04,
      "duration": 6.68
    },
    {
      "text": "that there is no pleasing the mob. So,",
      "start": 432.28,
      "duration": 6.04
    },
    {
      "text": "you know, if if people start dogpiling",
      "start": 435.72,
      "duration": 5.24
    },
    {
      "text": "you in your in your chat and you fire",
      "start": 438.32,
      "duration": 4.96
    },
    {
      "text": "staff members, for example, and pretend",
      "start": 440.96,
      "duration": 4.4
    },
    {
      "text": "that it was that you didn't fire them",
      "start": 443.28,
      "duration": 4.84
    },
    {
      "text": "simply because people don't like them.",
      "start": 445.36,
      "duration": 4.84
    },
    {
      "text": "That's pathetic. That's audience",
      "start": 448.12,
      "duration": 4.96
    },
    {
      "text": "capture. Tim Pool has never been that",
      "start": 450.2,
      "duration": 5.6
    },
    {
      "text": "guy. He does what he does.",
      "start": 453.08,
      "duration": 4.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Sure, he's had a few on-air meltdowns",
      "start": 455.8,
      "duration": 5.04
    },
    {
      "text": "before, but who hasn't? And um,",
      "start": 457.4,
      "duration": 5.96
    },
    {
      "text": "he's one of the good ones. You know, Tim",
      "start": 460.84,
      "duration": 5.36
    },
    {
      "text": "is just about business. He's about being",
      "start": 463.36,
      "duration": 5.72
    },
    {
      "text": "a good guy, being good husband, and he's",
      "start": 466.2,
      "duration": 4.6
    },
    {
      "text": "about",
      "start": 469.08,
      "duration": 4.88
    },
    {
      "text": "business. And I respect that greatly out",
      "start": 470.8,
      "duration": 5.92
    },
    {
      "text": "of him. And he's just",
      "start": 473.96,
      "duration": 4.44
    },
    {
      "text": "exactly what you would expect off",
      "start": 476.72,
      "duration": 4.76
    },
    {
      "text": "camera. He's not any different. And I've",
      "start": 478.4,
      "duration": 5.2
    },
    {
      "text": "come to respect that a lot more over the",
      "start": 481.48,
      "duration": 3.76
    },
    {
      "text": "years",
      "start": 483.6,
      "duration": 3.36
    },
    {
      "text": "because",
      "start": 485.24,
      "duration": 3.44
    },
    {
      "text": "I've seen so many examples of that being",
      "start": 486.96,
      "duration": 3.72
    },
    {
      "text": "the opposite. And that's",
      "start": 488.68,
      "duration": 3.56
    },
    {
      "text": "the exact reason I don't normally go to",
      "start": 490.68,
      "duration": 3.0
    },
    {
      "text": "these. You know, even when I went to",
      "start": 492.24,
      "duration": 2.88
    },
    {
      "text": "AmFest,",
      "start": 493.68,
      "duration": 2.52
    },
    {
      "text": "I didn't go to a single one of the",
      "start": 495.12,
      "duration": 4.96
    },
    {
      "text": "parties. And yes, I was invited, okay?",
      "start": 496.2,
      "duration": 5.36
    },
    {
      "text": "But I've seen what goes on at those",
      "start": 500.08,
      "duration": 2.64
    },
    {
      "text": "parties, and I don't want to be a part",
      "start": 501.56,
      "duration": 2.52
    },
    {
      "text": "of it.",
      "start": 502.72,
      "duration": 3.28
    },
    {
      "text": "So, when I went to AmFest, I",
      "start": 504.08,
      "duration": 4.24
    },
    {
      "text": "watched football with Melanie.",
      "start": 506.0,
      "duration": 4.0
    },
    {
      "text": "And that's what we did. We didn't",
      "start": 508.32,
      "duration": 4.279
    },
    {
      "text": "partake in that party culture.",
      "start": 510.0,
      "duration": 4.039
    },
    {
      "text": "And",
      "start": 512.599,
      "duration": 2.481
    },
    {
      "text": "you know,",
      "start": 514.039,
      "duration": 3.841
    },
    {
      "text": "I think that's fine for young kids in in",
      "start": 515.08,
      "duration": 4.28
    },
    {
      "text": "the community. Go ahead, get out there",
      "start": 517.88,
      "duration": 3.56
    },
    {
      "text": "and have fun. But you don't see Tim at",
      "start": 519.36,
      "duration": 3.96
    },
    {
      "text": "those parties, either. He's about his",
      "start": 521.44,
      "duration": 3.84
    },
    {
      "text": "business. He's about getting the job",
      "start": 523.32,
      "duration": 3.24
    },
    {
      "text": "done.",
      "start": 525.28,
      "duration": 3.44
    },
    {
      "text": "And that's what I respect the absolute",
      "start": 526.56,
      "duration": 5.08
    },
    {
      "text": "most about him. And so,",
      "start": 528.72,
      "duration": 5.119
    },
    {
      "text": "I am",
      "start": 531.64,
      "duration": 3.56
    },
    {
      "text": "I am",
      "start": 533.839,
      "duration": 4.361
    },
    {
      "text": "humbled by the business that he's built.",
      "start": 535.2,
      "duration": 6.72
    },
    {
      "text": "And perhaps too late, but I've adopted a",
      "start": 538.2,
      "duration": 6.72
    },
    {
      "text": "lot of the ways that he deals with",
      "start": 541.92,
      "duration": 4.84
    },
    {
      "text": "internet drama and things like that,",
      "start": 544.92,
      "duration": 2.96
    },
    {
      "text": "because he just doesn't give a",
      "start": 546.76,
      "duration": 3.16
    },
    {
      "text": "crap. He doesn't care.",
      "start": 547.88,
      "duration": 3.4
    },
    {
      "text": "And",
      "start": 549.92,
      "duration": 2.88
    },
    {
      "text": "that's what I respect the most about",
      "start": 551.28,
      "duration": 3.92
    },
    {
      "text": "him.",
      "start": 552.8,
      "duration": 2.4
    }
  ]
}
